WEBVTT

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:12.880
(Vogel) And so, after an
extensive investigation,

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:18.760
the Confederation has concluded
that insufficient evidence
exists...

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:22.480
to prosecute Gellert Grindelwald

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:25.040
for the crimes against
the Muggle community

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:27.440
-of which he was accused. -(gasps)

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:34.400
He is hereby absolved of
all his alleged crimes.

00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:36.440
(crowd clamoring)

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:38.440
Are you kidding me?

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:40.360
They're letting the guy off?

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:42.000
I was there, he was killing people.

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:44.200
You're under arrest.

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:46.680
All of you.

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:48.040
Wands down!

00:00:53.640 --> 00:00:54.800
(orders in German)

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:57.240
(Newt) Theseus.

00:00:58.600 --> 00:00:59.720
Theseus!

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:02.960
Newt, Newt. Not here.

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:05.520
Newt, we don't stand a chance.

00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:07.920
Let's go. Newt,

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.440
they have the German Ministry.
We've got to go.

00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:11.440
(Jacob) Whoa, whoa, whoa.

00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:13.840
It ain't right. That's not justice.

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:15.640
"Extended investigation."
I was there.

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:18.480
Were you there? Were you there?
I was there.

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:20.080
-You just let a killer off! -Jacob.

00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:21.400
Whoa!

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:23.240
We have to go. We have to go.

00:01:23.320 --> 00:01:25.120
Jacob, let's go.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:28.920
(dramatic choral music playing)

00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:39.160
(wind whistling)

00:01:39.720 --> 00:01:41.640
(fire crackling)

00:01:56.280 --> 00:01:57.760
That's very good.

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:02.320
Her favorite.

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:07.240
Remember how she begged
Mother to make it?

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:11.560
Ariana.

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:16.920
Mother claimed it calmed her, but I
think that was wishful thinking.

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:18.040
Albus.

00:02:19.440 --> 00:02:20.720
I was there.

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:22.880
I grew up in the same house.

00:02:22.960 --> 00:02:26.160
Everything you saw, I saw.

00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:32.560
Everything.

00:02:38.480 --> 00:02:39.640
(knock on door)

00:02:41.560 --> 00:02:42.520
(knocking continues)

00:02:44.120 --> 00:02:46.680
Read the sign, you stupid sod.

00:02:47.080 --> 00:02:48.240
(knock on door)

00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:56.280
I'm sorry to disturb you, Albus.

00:02:56.360 --> 00:02:57.760
Tell me, what is it?

00:02:57.840 --> 00:02:59.400
It's Berlin.

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:01.560
(Dumbledore) What happened?

00:03:01.640 --> 00:03:05.680
(McGonagall) Vogel has absolved
Gellert of all his crimes.

00:03:05.760 --> 00:03:08.400
He's free. He says there's no
proof.

00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:11.640
He tried to arrest
aurors who were there

00:03:11.680 --> 00:03:13.520
the night Leta Lestrange
was murdered.

00:03:13.600 --> 00:03:15.360
(soft whooshing)

00:03:22.880 --> 00:03:24.040
(mirror squeaks)

00:03:24.920 --> 00:03:26.560
(Dumbledore) Rather disappointing.

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:30.080
I'm going to need someone to
cover my morning classes.

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:31.800
Can I impose on you?

00:03:31.880 --> 00:03:34.440
Of course. And, Albus, please be...

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:36.320
I'll do my best.

00:03:38.520 --> 00:03:40.280
(McGonagall) Evening, Aberforth.

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:41.560
Evening, Minerva.

00:03:42.040 --> 00:03:43.920
Apologies for calling
you a stupid sod.

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:46.560
Apology accepted.

00:03:50.360 --> 00:03:52.760
(Dumbledore) I'm afraid I'll
have to cut our evening short.

00:03:52.840 --> 00:03:54.720
Off to save the world, are we?

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:56.800
That will take a better man than
me.

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:03.000
Don't ask.

00:04:08.960 --> 00:04:10.120
(door opens)

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:13.520
(door closes)

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:21.320
(mysterious music playing)

00:04:38.760 --> 00:04:42.160
There are thousands in the
streets chanting your name.

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:44.000
You're a free man.

00:04:49.120 --> 00:04:51.320
Tell the others to prepare to
leave.

00:04:52.320 --> 00:04:53.760
-Tonight? -Tomorrow.

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:56.600
We'll have a visitor in the
morning.

00:05:01.560 --> 00:05:03.400
(Rosier) Why does it stay with him?

00:05:04.480 --> 00:05:06.560
It must sense what he's about to
do.

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:09.760
And you're sure...

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:13.320
that he can kill Dumbledore?

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:16.960
His pain is his power.

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:20.560
(indistinct talking)

00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:23.720
(phones ringing)

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:26.600
The man that I am inquiring about
is the head of the British Auror
Office.

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:29.800
How can you have misplaced the
head of the British Auror Office?

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:36.120
As our contention said, since
he was never in our custody,

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:37.520
we never misplaced him.

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:39.080
Sir, there were dozens
of people there,

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:40.400
any one of them could
corroborate...

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:42.360
-And your name is? -(Jacob)
Let's get out of here.

00:05:43.240 --> 00:05:45.040
Wait a minute, that's the guy.

00:05:45.600 --> 00:05:47.120
Come here. Come here.

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:48.240
Excuse me!

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:49.360
Hey!

00:05:51.960 --> 00:05:53.560
That's the guy. He knows
where Theseus is.

00:05:53.640 --> 00:05:54.520
Hello!

00:05:55.880 --> 00:05:57.400
Where's Theseus?

00:05:57.520 --> 00:06:00.320
That's him. He knows about Theseus.

